ouler en 2 blocs. Le bloc est constitué de 2x30\" à intensité maximale entrecoupées de 2'30 de récupération en footing très lent. Deuxième partie du bloc avec 20' à ton allure 42 km suivies de 5' de récupération. Enchaîne alors une deuxième fois ce bloc.","displayName":"Force + Allure 42km","coachAdvice":"Dernière séance mix, maintenant que tu l'as vécue 2 fois, tu dois te rendre compte qu'elle n'est pas si terrible que cela ! Il faut juste prendre l'habitude de courir à allure 42 km avec les jambes \"lourdes\" ! Mais tu t'en rappelleras lors de ta compétition, vers le 30/35ème km quand ça commencera à être vraiment dur... ce sera du connu pour toi !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_2.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":150,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30.2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_2.5.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":598,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value